{
  "The steps of a longer task and where the user stands in them: an indicator and a text per step, a line between them, the steps before the current one completed. The [Wizard](/wizard) adds a page and the buttons to each step.": "",
  "The current step is `value`: a step’s `key`, else its index; `x-model` binds it two-way. Programmatically, `next()`, `previous()` and `goTo()` move it and `onStepChanged` tells.": "",
  "Statuses": "",
  "The steps before the current one are completed by themselves. An item may say `status: 'done'` or `'error'` whatever the current step is, be `optional`, be disabled, or carry an `icon` in place of its number; its fields may be functions of your state.": "",
  "Status": "",
  "A step to come: its number in the indicator.": "",
  "The step in hand: `aria-current=\"step\"`.": "",
  "The steps before the current one, and any step whose item says `status: 'done'`: a check in the indicator, the line before it filled.": "",
  "A step whose item says `status: 'error'`: a mark in the indicator, the text in the danger colour; read out as “Needs attention”.": "",
  "Says “Optional” under the text; in linear order it may be skipped.": "",
  "An item with `enabled: false`, or a step linear order does not reach yet: `aria-disabled`, out of the Tab order.": "",
  "In order, or free": "",
  "`linear` (the default) lets a press reach only the completed steps and the next one; `linear={false}` lets it reach any. Either way `onStepChanging` is asked first: `cancel` keeps the step, a `promise` waits for a check or a server.": "",
  "Orientations": "",
  "One stop: the step focused last, else the current one, else the first that can be reached.": "",
  "Left and Right (Up and Down standing) move between the steps that can be reached, around the ends; Home and End go to the first and the last.": "",
  "Choose the focused step; `onStepChanging` may refuse.": "",
  "A `nav` named “Steps” in the kit language, holding an ordered list; several on one page: give each its own `label`.": "",
  "A button whose name reads “Step 2 of 4, Address, Where to send it, Completed”: the position, the texts and the status are all in it.": "",
  "Plain elements: nothing to press, the current one still `aria-current`.": "",
  "Decorative, hidden from readers.": "",
  "The stepper. `data-orientation`, `data-labels`, `data-size`.": "",
  "The list and each step with its line. `data-status` on the item.": "",
  "The step: a button or a div. `data-status`, `aria-current`, `aria-disabled`.": "",
  "The circle, the number in it, the check or error mark, an icon of your own.": "",
  "The texts.": "",
  "The line to the next step. `data-status=\"done\"` up to the current one.": "",
  "Units: the step (`hover`, `pressed`, `focus`, `disabled`, `current`, `done`, `error`), its indicator, the mark (`icon` per state), the texts, the line (`done`); the line turns a quarter in a vertical stepper.": "",
  "The indicator, the text and the space around a step, per size.": "",
  "The second line, the space between indicator and texts, and the line’s margins and least length.": "",
  "The steps in order: `StepperItem`s (`text`, `description`, `key`, `icon`, `status`, `optional`, `enabled`, `data`) or plain texts.": "",
  "The current step: its `key`, else its index; `null` for none. `x-model` binds it two-way.": "",
  "A press reaches a completed step, or the one right after the last completed; optional steps may be skipped.": "",
  "`horizontal` or `vertical`.": "",
  "Horizontal only: the texts under the indicator (`bottom`) or after it (`end`).": "",
  "`false` shows the way only: no buttons, no Tab stop.": "",
  "The indicator of a step to come shows its number.": "",
  "The current step is about to change (`from`, `to`, `fromItem`, `toItem`, `byUser`). `cancel = true` keeps it; `promise` set to a `Promise<boolean>` waits, and the step changes when it resolves to `true`.": "",
  "The current step changed (`index`, `item`, `previous`, `byUser`).": "",
  "The index of the current step; -1 when there is none.": "",
  "How many steps there are.": "",
  "There is an enabled step after, or before, the current one.": "",
  "Goes to the next or the previous enabled step; `false` when there is none or the change was refused.": "",
  "Goes to a step by index or key, whatever the order; `onStepChanging` is asked first.": "",
  "`pending`, `current`, `done` or `error`, as drawn.": "",
  "Whether a press may reach the step.": ""
}
